# fluoxetine.msf
# Fluoxetine  pKa=10.050 (methylammonium→methylamine, q=+1→0)
# Source: Avdeef 2001
# SSRI antidepressant. Secondary methylamine; pKa=10.05 → >99.9%
# protonated at pH 7.4. The CF3 group on the aryl ether lowers the LUMO
# substantially (ΔE_LUMO effect) and tests whether BO_ring captures
# the effect of a strong para-EW substituent on N-H acidity through
# the three-bond O-Ar-CF3 linkage.

